# iCloud's copies of this repo.
# This project lives in a synced ~/Documents, and iCloud periodically duplicates the whole
# tree as "mark 2.ts", "favicon 2.ico" and so on. There were 2,978 of them on 2026-10-02,
# and deleting them does not hold: new ones appeared within the hour. They are never
# wanted, and ignoring them removes the real danger, which is `git add -A` committing a
# few thousand of them. It does not stop them polluting a local build, because Astro reads
# the directory rather than the index and a copy under src/pages becomes a real route:
# that is what the Finder-duplicate check in scripts/smoke-dist.ts is for. CI is unaffected
# either way, since it builds from a clean checkout.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
